#: ../../docs/tools/algorithm-builder/index.md:32
#: 5b8af3b38af44063beff5e4263d44f4e
msgid ""
"The panel follows `Mission → Build → Check → Colab → Return → Reflect`. It "
"preserves the build across retries and restart, supports keyboard card "
"ordering, undo/redo, autosave, a learner-written model-limit explanation, "
"and explicit JSON recovery."
msgstr ""
"The panel follows `Mission → Build → Check → Colab → Return → Reflect`. It "
"preserves the build across retries and restart, supports keyboard card "
"ordering, undo/redo, autosave, a learner-written model-limit explanation, "
"and explicit JSON recovery."

#: ../../docs/tools/algorithm-builder/index.md:34
#: 229ebb3a46ff46169d44a3221b31ce63
msgid ""
"The production bundle, engine, broker, notebook parity, privacy, and "
"permission tests pass locally. The public runtime remains pending until real"
" Auth0, HTTPS/Postgres, unpacked Chromium, and live Colab acceptance are "
"complete."
msgstr ""
"The production bundle, engine, broker, notebook parity, privacy, and "
"permission tests pass locally. The public runtime remains pending until real"
" Auth0, HTTPS/Postgres, unpacked Chromium, and live Colab acceptance are "
"complete."

#: ../../docs/tools/algorithm-builder/index.md:37
#: 7c47e6a6c0c74babb9aa53293be90b55
msgid ""
"The Builder owns editable artifacts, not missions or progression. AlgoQuest "
"remains the sole pedagogical authority, and local verification is never "
"labelled as Colab evidence."
msgstr ""
"The Builder owns editable artifacts, not missions or progression. AlgoQuest "
"remains the sole pedagogical authority, and local verification is never "
"labelled as Colab evidence."

